<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AAA to NTT's $500 mln Eurobond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA to NTT's $500 mln Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Friday that it had assigned its AAA rating to Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp's (NTT) $500 million 6.750 percent Eurobonds, maturing on May 16, 2002.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is negative, S&amp;P added.</p>
<p>The rating decision is based on NTT's dominant position and important role in the Japanese telecommunications market, and its strong cash flow and financial profile among major international telecommunication firms.</p>
</text>
